\id NUM  
\h Minbu 
\toc1 Minbu 
\toc2 Minbu 
\toc3 Minbu 
\mt1 MOSE LEKHABU LINA NUMBERS  
\mt2 MINBU  
\mt3 Minbu sungthu umdan  
\ip Minbu hi, Israelten gamtepgam ajot uva Pathen lamhil anga jinglai u, Sinai Molsang a ahung kondoh a kipat Israel khangthahho gamtepgam alutding kon chan u thusim ahi. Hiche lekhabu isim sung uva hi phunchielna, noplouna thulhuh, dousetna ho lhepna a ina lhahna hou chu ngaiton a, amite atundohkit nading a Pathen in phat ijat alutsah em tiho hi ngaito ding ahi.  
\ip Minbu hi Pathen mite Israelte a ding a kijih ahin, kum somli jen gamthip lah a akimanchahna hou kijihlutna ahi. Hiche thusim hin achesa phat ho, phat ahunglhung ding semtoh ahina, Pathen in angailut Israel athohhatna leh akitahna a apuihoina, chule achondihna a chonset thutanna aneiding ho hetsahna ding ahi.  
\ip Minbu hi Israel mite gamthip noija avaithamnao le, Sinai molsanga kipat Jordan vadung changei hop thusim ahin, kum somli lhingdeh thusim ahi (hichu kum somthum le kumget leh lhako). Israel mite Egypt gam a kon a ahung potdoh uchun, Mose in thu-hettohsah din Canaan gam a mi asol in ahi. Amaho thu hinlhut chun tahsan na sang in kichatna in alhut in. Hijeh chun niseh in guhtim a Canaan gamkholtoh ding in thu hettohsahho akalsong jing un ahi, akitahlou jeh uchun hilai dinmun a chun kumkhat ana vaitham uvin ahi.(Numbers 14: 33-34).  
\is1 Lekhbu jihpa chule akijih kum  
\ip Minbu hi Mose in kum somli vel lut in anajih in ahi. Hichu 1406 BC a Israel mite Egypt gam a pat ahung kitoldoh uva pat a kisim pan ahi.  
\c 1  
\s1 Israel chate min kilah masat pat  
\p
\v 1 Israelten Egypt gamsung ahin dalhah kal u kum khat ahung lhin chun Pathen in Sinai gamthip a houbuh a chun Mose ahoulimpi tan ahi. Hichu alhani channa nikho masapen ni ahin, Pakaiyin hitin asei peh e,  
\v 2 “Israel namsung pumpi a kon in aphung cheh uva kon a gal hangsanho leh ainsung mihou min jouseu aumden ding in jihlut cheh in. Pasalho jouse chu jihlut soh hel in.  
\v 3 Kum somni apat chunglam gal boltheiho jouse chu Nang le Aaronnin amin u najihlut teitei lhon ding,  
\v 4 chuleh hiche phungho jouse lah a kon a chu lamkai khat cheh in nangma nakithopi ding ahi.  
\v 5 “Hiche phungho a kon a Lamkai hohi nakithopi dingho chu ahiuve.  
\s1 Phung(Tribe) Lamkai(Leader)  
\li1 Reuben Shedeur chapa Elizur   
\li1
\v 6 Simeon Zurishaddai chapa Shelumiel   
\li1
\v 7 Judah Anminadab chapa Nahshon   
\li1
\v 8 Issachar Zuar chapa Nethanael   
\li1
\v 9 Zebulun Helon chapa Eliab   
\li1
\v 10 Joseph chapa Ephraim Ammihud chapa Elishama  
\li1 Joseph chapa Manasseh Pedahzur chapa Gamaliel   
\li1
\v 11 Benjamin Gideoni chapa Abidan   
\li1
\v 12 Dan Ammishaddai chapa Ahiezer   
\li1
\v 13 Asher Ocran chapa Pagiel   
\li1
\v 14 Gad Deuel chapa Eliasaph   
\li1
\v 15 Naphtali Enan chapa Ahira   
\p
\v 16 Amahohi japilah akon a kilhengdoh lamkai cheh, apu apa phung kailhah a pat lamkaiho chuleh Israelte phung hoa kon a mi upa cheh ahiuve.”  
\v 17 Hichun lamkai kilhen doh chengse chu Mose le Aaron in akou khom lhonin,  
\v 18 hiche nikho ma ma chun Israelte jalhang pumpin jong akhom tup lhonin ahi. Mipiho jouse chu ama ama phung leh insung cheh kailhah a konin amin akijihlut cheh in ahi. Pathen in Mose athupeh bangin, Israel pasal kum somnia pat chunglamse chu khat khatnin akijihlut in ahi.  
\v 19 Hitichun Mose in amaho min jouse Sinai gamthip lai mun a chun anasutup soh keiyin ahi.  
\v 20-21 Ama ama phung dungjui cheh a amin u kijihlut bang a pasal kum somnia pat achunglam galsat a konthei amijatho chu hicheng hi ahi.  
